    "source": {
      "value": "sf2"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "_The Midwife_ represents the arrival of new life or new information, particularly via the aid of another. As long as you have _The Midwife_ invested, it grants a +2 item bonus to Medicine checks. This increases to a +3 bonus if you are at least 17th level.\n\n- **Activate:** Reaction\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n- **Trigger:** A creature you can sense within 60 feet would due or be destroyed\n\nYou prevent the target from dying or being destroyed and restore to the target 6d8+24 Hit Points. This effect can prevent a death effect or disintegrate from slaying a target. The amount of healing granted increases to 7d8+28 if you're at least 15th level, 8d8+32 if you're at least 17th level, and 9d8+36 if you're at least 19th level."
    },
